    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sekwenziwe konke lokho, izinduna zeza kimi zathi: AbakoIsrayeli labapristi lamaLevi kabazahlukanisanga labantu bezizwe lamanyala abo, amaKanani lamaHethi lamaPerizi lamaJebusi lamaAmoni lamaMowabi lamaGibithe lamaAmori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazithathele emadodakazini azo ukuba abe ngomkabo labamadodana abo, kwaze kwaxubana isizwe esingcwele labantu bezizwe. Kulobububi izinduna lezikhulu yizo eziphambili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngisizwa lokho ngadabula ingubo zami lesigqoko sami, ngangcothula inwele ekhanda lami lendevu zami, ngahlala phansi ngathithibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abawesabayo amazwi kaNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli babuthana kimi ngenxa yobubi babathunjiweyo ababuyileyo, mina ngihlezi ngithithibele kwaze kwaba yisikhathi somnikelo wakusihlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngesikhathi somnikelo wakusihlwa ngasukuma ekuzileni kwami ukudla, ingubo yami lesigqoko sami kudabukile, ngaguqa ngamadolo ami, ngaphakamisela izandla zami eNkosini uNkulunkulu wami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngathi: Wena Nkulunkulu wami, ngilenhloni, ngiyesaba ukukukhangela, Nkulunkulu wami, ngoba ububi bethu buphakeme ngaphezu kwamakhanda ethu lesono sethu sifinyelele ezulwini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusukela ensukwini zabokhokho kuze kube lamhla besiphakathi kwesono esikhulu, langenxa yobubi bethu thina lamakhosi ethu labapristi bethu sinikelwe ezandleni zamakhosi ezizwe lasekubhujisweni lasekuthunjweni lasekuphangweni lasehlazweni elibi njengalamhlanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa okwesikhatshana esifitshane nje iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu ibisenzele umusa ngokusitshiyela ingcosana lokusinika isikhundla endaweni yayo engcwele, ukuze uNkulunkulu wethu asithokozise asivuselele ebugqilini bethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba siyizigqili, kanti uNkulunkulu wethu kasiyekelanga ebugqilini bethu, kodwa usenzele umusa emehlweni amakhosi asePerisiya, ukusivuselela ukuba sakhe indlu kaNkulunkulu wethu, silungise unxiwa lwayo lokusivikela koJuda laseJerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesike, Nkulunkulu wethu, sizakuthini ngemva kwalokho na? Ngoba siyidelile imilayo yakho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owasilaya yona ngezinceku zakho abaprofethi, wathi: Ilizwe elingena kulo ukuba libe ngelenu liyilizwe elingcoliswe ngamanyala abantu belizwe, baligcwalisile ngengcekeza yabo kusukela komunye umngcele kusiya komunye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke lingendiseli amadodana abo amadodakazi enu, futhi lingathatheli amadodana enu amadodakazi abo, lingabenzeli okuhle lempumelelo ukuba liqine lidle okuhle kwelizwe, lilitshiyele abantwana benu libe yilizwe labo kokuphela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.11+EXO.34.12+EXO.34.13+EXO.34.14+EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 34:11–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 7:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwakho konke okusehleleyo ngenxa yezenzo zethu ezimbi langenxa yesono sethu esikhulu, lanxa wena Nkulunkulu wethu usitshaye ngokungalingani lezono zethu, wasiyekela siyingcosana enje, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sizakuyephula futhi yini imilayo yakho, sibuye sithathane labantu abenza lezizinto ezingcolileyo na? Kawuyikusithukuthelela ukuze usiqede kungasali lengcosana loba loyedwa ophunyukayo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkosi, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, wena ulungile, usitshiyile siyingcosana ephunyukileyo njengalamhlanje. Sesikhona phambi kwakho lezono zethu: ngenxa yazo kakho loyedwa ongema phambi kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
